  "timers": [
<%# Thermal-runaway clock. Modelled on sis02_energy/scenario.json.erb:387-450, which is
    the worked example for this engine feature (ScenarioTimerDispatcher + ScenarioTimerUI).

    M2: both timers start on attack_mechanism_known -- the moment the player has
    proved how the attack works (all four OT-network flags in) -- NOT on
    anomaly_detected. Starting on anomaly_detected meant both clocks ran on
    wall-time through the whole VM stage, so COSTLY SUCCESS was effectively the
    default outcome. The countdown is now the final act: mechanism proven -> race
    to the plant room and the hardwired ESD. Cancelled by the shutdown
    (attack_prevented). Reload is lenient: if the start global is already set the
    dispatcher restarts the clock from the reload moment
    (scenario-timer-dispatcher.js:37-38), so a reload never strands the player.

    DELIBERATE DIVERGENCE FROM sis02: its h2_evacuation timer fires a
    `show_end_screen` action with outcome "failure" and a "Return to Missions" button,
    which ends the run. m04 must NOT do that. Failure here is avoidable and
    player-caused, but the mission still reaches an ending: the second timer sets
    racks_vented / casualties_occurred and play continues to the debrief and the
    bond_visualiser. See ALIGNMENT_PLAN.md "Decisions taken" #10.

    m04's consequences are larger than sis02's single-facility evacuation: 240,000 on
    the grid, the night crew in Hall 2, and the dropped feed. %>
<%# PASS 3 P11b: the trigger race. FIRST in this array on purpose: the HUD shows
    the first pending showCountdown timer in array order (scenario-timer.js:122-156),
    so placed after h2_advisory it would be hidden. A reload or player KO during the
    race respawns the player at the entrance while the race restarts, so it fires:
    the race is forfeit by design, and Voltage's ink holds the after-state
    (voltage_after_trigger). %>
    {
      "id": "trigger_race",
      "label": "Voltage \u2014 the laptop",
      "startOnGlobal": "voltage_fight_started",
      "delayMs": 25000,
      "cancelOnGlobal": "voltage_neutralised",
      "condition": "!globalVars.voltage_neutralised && !globalVars.attack_prevented && !globalVars.racks_vented",
      "setGlobal": { "racks_vented": true, "casualties_occurred": true, "vented_by_trigger": true, "urgency_stage": 4 },
      "showCountdown": true,
      "onceOnly": true,
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "tint_objects",
          "roomId": "battery_hall_2",
          "textureKey": "batrack",
          "color": 16729122,
          "pulse": true
        },
        {
          "type": "hint",
          "title": "HE REACHED THE LAPTOP",
          "message": "Bank B is going. He's still in the plant room, and so is the button. A and C are still yours to save."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h2_advisory",
      "label": "H\u2082 Advisory \u2014 rack bank B",
      "startOnGlobal": "attack_mechanism_known",
      "delayMs": 480000,
      "cancelOnGlobal": "attack_prevented",
      "condition": "!globalVars.attack_prevented && !globalVars.racks_vented",
      "setGlobal": { "hydrogen_alarm": true, "urgency_stage": 3 },
      "showCountdown": true,
      "onceOnly": true,
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "tint_objects",
          "roomId": "battery_hall_2",
          "textureKey": "batrack",
          "color": 16729122,
          "pulse": true
        },
        {
          "type": "hint",
          "title": "H\u2082 ADVISORY \u2014 RACK BANK B",
          "message": "The hydrogen alarm in Battery Hall 2 has gone. Bank B is venting. The hardwired ESD pushbutton is in the plant room."
        }
      ]
    },
<%# Second stage: the racks vent for real. This does NOT end the mission -- it sets the
    partial-failure state, which the debrief and the credits branch on. The player can
    still reach the ESD and still reaches an ending. %>
    {
      "id": "racks_vent",
      "label": "Thermal runaway \u2014 rack bank B",
      "startOnGlobal": "attack_mechanism_known",
      "delayMs": 840000,
      "cancelOnGlobal": "attack_prevented",
      "condition": "!globalVars.attack_prevented && !globalVars.racks_vented",
      "setGlobal": { "racks_vented": true, "casualties_occurred": true, "urgency_stage": 4 },
      "showCountdown": false,
      "onceOnly": true,
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hint",
          "title": "THERMAL RUNAWAY \u2014 BANK B",
          "message": "Bank B has gone. The hall is burning and the feed has dropped. It is not over \u2014 banks A and C are still holding, and the shutdown will still save them. Get to the button."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],

